--- Page 12 ---
Solution Design
Solution Format:
**Digital Product – AI Camera Mobile
App**Core Technologies/ Methodologies:
**Computer Vision, AI/ML models, real-time video stabilization algorithms,
object tracking, and mobile app development using FlutterOur Solution
AI-Assisted Camera App – A
smartphone camera application that
automatically stabilizes videos, tracks
subjects, and enhances footage in real
time so beginners can record stable,
well-framed photosKey Features
**Real-time video stabilization, AI
subject tracking, auto framing,
environment-based camera settings,
and automatic video enhancement to
reduce blur and shake for beginners.**Uniqueness
An AI-powered camera app that
combines real-time stabilization,
subject tracking, and auto-framing in
one system, allowing beginners to
record smooth, professional-looking
videos without extra equips 

